      "content": "It is possible your devices are linked to a scheduled automation that has been inadvertently set up. You should first check the routines or automations within the Google Home and Philips Hue apps to see if a nightly trigger exists for both actions. If those settings look clean, you can review the activity log within your respective account settings for login locations and unusual activity. This will help determine if the issue is a misconfiguration or unauthorized access.",
